cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "AR-Rehab: Raw per-session logs for occlusion-resilient mixed reality upper-limb rehabilitation"
abstract: >-
  Raw per-session logs from an occlusion-resilient visuo-inertial smart-object
  system for upper-limb rehabilitation, recorded with instrumented therapeutic
  cubes and a Meta Quest 3 headset during a preliminary six-participant
  feasibility study at the Hospital Nacional de Paraplejicos (Toledo, Spain).
  Each session directory contains synchronized CSV streams: smart-object
  inertial and grip-pressure telemetry, YOLOv8-Pose visual detections with
  keypoint coordinates, fused 6-DoF pose estimates, per-frame cube state with
  tracking source and contact level, participant head and hand kinematics,
  automatically segmented interaction episodes, serious-game events, and
  yaw-calibration records. Participant data are anonymised.
